flowchart TB
    U[User] <--> UI[React UI]
    UI <-->|Login/register and JWT requests| API[FastAPI API gateway]
    API --> AUTH[Authentication and account security]
    API --> UPLOAD[Upload API]
    API --> ANALYSIS[Query / Analysis API]
    API --> HS[History, profile and security settings]
    DB[(One PostgreSQL database<br/>users/auth · quick responses<br/>sessions · reports/images<br/>quality/status · summaries/evidence<br/>chat/history · diagnostics)]
    AUTH <-->|Credentials, hashes, profile| DB
    HS <-->|Read/update/archive/restore/delete| DB

    subgraph INGESTION[INGESTION PIPELINE — runs when files are uploaded]
        direction TB
        IV[Validate before storage<br/>1–3 files · PDF/PNG/JPG/JPEG<br/>non-empty · ≤25 MB<br/>PDF signature / image decoding]
        IVOK{Initial validation passed?}
        EARLY[Upload error<br/>File not stored]
        STORE[Store accepted bytes<br/>in session upload folder]
        META[Create PostgreSQL file metadata<br/>Status: Uploaded]
        TYPE{PDF or image?}
        PDF[Extract PDF page text<br/>Tesseract OCR for low-text pages]
        PCLEAN[Medical-text cleaning]
        PCHUNK[Overlapping chunks<br/>2400 chars / 300 overlap]
        PQ[PDF ingestion-quality score 0–100<br/>readable text: 65 base<br/>text volume: up to 25<br/>searchable chunks: 10]
        PQOK{PDF readable and<br/>score ≥ 40?}
        PTEXT[MedCPT Article Encoder]
        IQ[Image quality inspection<br/>resolution · content · sharpness<br/>score 0–100]
        IQOK{Image checks passed and<br/>score ≥ 40?}
        IOCR[Tesseract OCR<br/>optional and non-fatal]
        OCLEAN[Clean and chunk OCR text]
        OTEXT[MedCPT Article Encoder]
        IVIS[BiomedCLIP image encoder]
        REJECT[Retain stored file<br/>Status: Rejected<br/>Persist score and reasons]
        CT[(Private text ChromaDB<br/>report and image-OCR vectors<br/>user/session metadata)]
        CI[(Private image ChromaDB<br/>BiomedCLIP vectors<br/>user/session metadata)]
        INDEXED[Persist Indexed status<br/>quality score and reasons]
        IV --> IVOK
        IVOK -->|No| EARLY
        IVOK -->|Yes| STORE --> META --> TYPE
        TYPE -->|PDF| PDF
        PDF -->|Unreadable / extraction failure| REJECT
        PDF --> PCLEAN --> PCHUNK --> PQ --> PQOK
        PQOK -->|No| REJECT
        PQOK -->|Yes| PTEXT --> CT
        TYPE -->|Image| IQ --> IQOK
        IQOK -->|No| REJECT
        IQOK -->|Yes| IOCR
        IQOK -->|Yes| IVIS --> CI
        IOCR -->|Text found| OCLEAN --> OTEXT --> CT
        IOCR -->|No text| INDEXED
        CT --> INDEXED
        CI --> INDEXED
        REJECT --> DB
        INDEXED --> DB
    end
    UPLOAD --> IV

    subgraph QUERY[QUERY / ANALYSIS PIPELINE — runs when the user asks a question]
        direction TB
        LOAD[Load owned session/files<br/>Idempotent ingestion recovery]
        CONSIST[Cross-file consistency<br/>PDF text + image OCR identity signals]
        MATCH{Explicit patient/case mismatch?}
        MISMATCH[Deterministic mismatch response<br/>No AI analysis]
        DOCSCOPE{Uploaded content oncology-related?}
        SCOPEEXIT[Deterministic out-of-scope response]
        PRIVATE[Retrieve private evidence<br/>user_id + session_id filter]
        PDFIMG[Extract useful embedded PDF images<br/>and inspect image quality]
        SAFETY[Deterministic safety routing]
        SAFETYEXIT[Safety response]
        QUICK{Text-only quick response?}
        QUICKEXIT[Active PostgreSQL quick response]
        QSCOPE{Oncology scope?}
        LC[LangChain RunnableLambda<br/>ClinicalAnalysisPipeline]
        PRE[Bounded query preprocessing<br/>NFC · whitespace · controls<br/>OCR-hyphen repair; not chunked]
        MQ[MedCPT Query Encoder<br/>text-vector search]
        BQ[BiomedCLIP text/image encoder<br/>image-vector search]
        RCT[(Shared reference text ChromaDB<br/>MedCPT article vectors)]
        RCI[(Shared reference image ChromaDB<br/>BiomedCLIP vectors)]
        MODE{Ranking by query type}
        TEXTMODE[Text query<br/>MedCPT primary evidence<br/>filtered image support]
        IMGMODE[Image/OCR or multi-image<br/>Weighted Reciprocal Rank Fusion]
        SELECT[Clinical preference ranking<br/>deduplicate and select references]
        DIAG[Retrieval diagnostics/timing<br/>scores are uncalibrated]
        CONTEXT[Grounded context<br/>uploads + private excerpts<br/>references + session history]
        PROMPT[Build grounded prompt]
        GEMINI[Gemini structured JSON]
        VALID[JSON/schema and citation validation]
        GOOD{Valid answer?}
        REPAIR[Transient retry / schema repair]
        FALLBACK[Gemini-degraded or<br/>extractive uploaded-fact fallback]
        CONTRACT[Pydantic response validation<br/>care-urgency signal + diagnostics]
        SAVE[Persist result, evidence, citations,<br/>diagnostics, timing and chat history<br/>legacy confidence_score = mean accepted-file<br/>ingestion quality; calibrated = false]
        RESPONSE[FastAPI response]
        LOAD --> CONSIST --> MATCH
        MATCH -->|Yes| MISMATCH --> SAVE
        MATCH -->|No; warnings may continue| DOCSCOPE
        DOCSCOPE -->|No| SCOPEEXIT --> SAVE
        DOCSCOPE -->|Yes| PRIVATE --> PDFIMG --> SAFETY
        SAFETY -->|Triggered| SAFETYEXIT --> SAVE
        SAFETY -->|Continue| QUICK
        QUICK -->|Yes| QUICKEXIT --> SAVE
        QUICK -->|No| QSCOPE
        QSCOPE -->|Out of scope| SCOPEEXIT
        QSCOPE -->|Continue| LC --> PRE
        PRE --> MQ --> RCT
        PRE --> BQ --> RCI
        RCT --> MODE
        RCI --> MODE
        MODE -->|Text| TEXTMODE --> SELECT
        MODE -->|Image / multimodal| IMGMODE --> SELECT
        SELECT --> DIAG --> CONTEXT --> PROMPT --> GEMINI --> VALID --> GOOD
        GOOD -->|Yes| CONTRACT
        GOOD -->|No| REPAIR
        REPAIR -->|Repaired| VALID
        REPAIR -->|Still unusable| FALLBACK --> CONTRACT
        CONTRACT --> SAVE --> DB
        SAVE --> RESPONSE
    end
    ANALYSIS --> LOAD
    DB --> LOAD
    CT --> PRIVATE
    CI --> PRIVATE
    DB --> QUICKEXIT
    DB --> CONTEXT
    EARLY --> API
    RESPONSE --> API
    API --> UI --> U

